{"page_id": "synth_copies-images_sv97b48ceb-p1", "markdown": "# SCHOUSING\n\nFinancing Housing. Building SC.\n\nHOMEOWNERSHIP MORTGAGE PURCHASE PROGRAM\n\nAFFIDAVIT OF NON-TAXPAYER\n\nSTATE OF SOUTH CAROLINA\n\nCOUNTY OF\n\nRichland\n\nAFFIDAVIT OF NON - TAXPAYER\n\n(18 years of age or older)\n\nPERSONALLY appeared before me the following person(s):\n\n(Please mark only the individual(s) to which this Affidavit applies)\n\n<table>\n<tr><td rowspan=\"2\">John D. Smith</td><td rowspan=\"2\">BORROWER CO-BORROWER</td><td rowspan=\"2\">2022</td><td rowspan=\"2\">2023</td><td rowspan=\"2\">2024Śęł</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mary A. Smith</td><td>OCCUPANT</td><td>2022</td><td>2023</td><td>2024</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Michael B. Smith</td><td>OCCUPANT</td><td>2022</td><td>2023</td><td>2024</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>OCCUPANT</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n凶\n\nYEARS NOT FILED\n\nwho, being duly sworn, depose(s) and say(s):\n\n1.\n\nThat during the above referenced tax year(s), he (they) were not required to file a Federal Income Tax Return with the Internal Revenue Service;\n\n2.\n\nThat during such year(s), the applicant(s) was (were) not required to file a Federal Income Tax Return according to the provisions of the U.S. Internal Revenue Code;\n\n3. That this Affidavit is given in order to comply with the provisions of the Mortgage Subsidy Bond Tax Act of 1980, and is intended to be relied upon by SC Housing in determining the eligibility of any proposed Mortgage Loan and DPA for purchase by SC Housing as part of its Homeownership Mortgage Purchase Program.\n\n(Signatures only required for individuals indicated above)\n\nJohn D. Smith\n\nSignature- Applicant\n\nMary A. Smith\n\nSignature - Occupant\n\n(18 years of age or older)\n\nJane R. Smith\n\nSignature -Co- Applicant\n\nMichael B. Smith\n\nSignature - Occupant\n\n(18 years of age or older)\n\nSignature - Occupant\n\n(18 years of age or older)\n\nSWORN to before me this 15th\n\nLaura K. Johnson\n\nNotary Public for South Carolina\n\nMy Commission expires 06/30/2028\n\nSF-027 AFFIDAVIT ON NON-TAX PAYER\n\nday of May\n\n• 20 25\n\n(Seal)", "width": 1654, "height": 2340, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "SCHOUSING", "bbox": {"x": 568.7367331261125, "y": 46.13727684105228, "width": 394.90888245526475, "height": 73.4754445552828}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Financing Housing. Building SC.", "bbox": {"x": 661.5999997567648, "y": 121.87499998034265, "width": 301.61176470588236, "height": 24.375000000000174}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "HOMEOWNERSHIP MORTGAGE PURCHASE PROGRAM", "bbox": {"x": 452.417644808897, "y": 180.37499957343746, "width": 666.4647058823531, "height": 34.12500000000014}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "AFFIDAVIT OF NON-TAXPAYER", "bbox": {"x": 593.4941174101414, "y": 224.24999998100657, "width": 384.31176470588235, "height": 29.249999999999897}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "STATE OF SOUTH CAROLINA", "bbox": {"x": 77.8352938744118, "y": 350.99999997996565, "width": 355.1235294117647, "height": 29.250000000000156}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "COUNTY OF", "bbox": {"x": 72.97058799205881, "y": 443.62499996191417, "width": 165.4, "height": 24.374999999999915}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Richland", "bbox": {"x": 262.4527693943447, "y": 437.7552779590383, "width": 136.6944607229794, "height": 36.11444395780574}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "AFFIDAVIT OF NON - TAXPAYER", "bbox": {"x": 865.9176468213794, "y": 389.99999998258943, "width": 428.09411764705897, "height": 29.249999999999897}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(18 years of age or older)", "bbox": {"x": 919.4294114921147, "y": 438.74999997058194, "width": 316.20588235294116, "height": 34.12499999999988}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "PERSONALLY appeared before me the following person(s):", "bbox": {"x": 72.9705879936804, "y": 550.8749999902499, "width": 734.5705882352942, "height": 29.250000000000156}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(Please mark only the individual(s) to which this Affidavit applies)", "bbox": {"x": 77.83529387